[ti:Two Minutes Hate]
[ar:EdgarAllanMusic]
[al:1984s.text - Rectified]
[length:05:13.91]

[00:02.16]Eleven hundred hours. Records Department
[00:05.44]Everyone drags their chair toward the big screen
[00:09.59]Comrades... the Hate is about to begin
[00:13.89]...freedom of speech... freedom of thought
[00:17.63]I don't want to shout... and my mouth is already open
[00:38.80]Here it comes
[02:26.66]Monstrous machine starts grinding without oil
[02:31.50]Face on the screen makes your blood boil
[02:35.37]A sheep's face bleating venom and lies
[02:40.09]Audience screaming while the hatred rises
[02:43.84]B-B... B-B
[02:48.60]Two minutes hate... you scream with the rest
[02:52.51]Your mouth is theirs but there's something in your chest
[03:01.19]B-B... B-B
[03:10.91]The hate jumps like a flame from screen to screen
[03:15.32]From the sheep to the Brother, then the girl behind
[03:19.40]Scarlet sash, dark hair, and the eyes that bind
[03:24.13]You want to break her, you want her... you lose your mind
[03:30.05]B-B... B-B
[03:33.10]Two minutes hate... you scream with the rest
[03:37.02]Your mouth is theirs but there's something in your chest
[03:45.62]B-B... B-B
[03:47.75]A heavy man in glasses turns and holds your eyes
[03:56.42]For one blink you know... then the moment dies
[04:27.56]The face dissolves... into the one that never sleeps
[04:36.70]B-B... B-B
[05:13.90]
